{
  "name": "Brightheart",
  "type": "character",
  "img": "systems/heroic5e/assets/characters/brightheart/Portrait-Brightheart.png",
  "system": {
    "biography": "Erin Bennett — Brightheart\n\n“The City's Hope”\n\nClass: Beacon\nOrigin: Cosmic\nCalling: Idealist\nSide: Heroic\n\nSecret ID: Erin Bennett\n\nBrightheart feels like the kind of superhero people grow up reading about. Noble, hopeful, compassionate, and genuinely selfless, she carries herself with the warmth and sincerity of someone who truly believes the world can become better.\n\nWhere Ghost Fox represents vengeance and Nightshade represents struggle, Brightheart represents hope. She comforts civilians after battles, remembers names, and reminds the team why the work matters.\n\nPersonality: Optimistic, empathetic, emotionally resilient, and endlessly encouraging. Erin believes kindness matters just as much as strength.\n\nPowers: Radiant solar-light energy, flight, protective force fields, healing/inspiring bursts, and hard-light defensive constructs.",
    "notes": "Combat Reference\nPower Die: d8\nProwess: +2\nTrained Saves: WIS, CHA.\nTrained Skills: Athletics, Influence, Insight, Investigation, Medicine, Notice.\nClass EV (CHA): 16\nEnergy EV (CHA): 16",
